<LegalLayout title="Self-Hosting Privacy & Data Control" description="Privacy and data control for self-hosted Invoice Ninja." lastUpdated="January 19, 2025" path="/self-hosting-privacy-data-control/">
  <h2>Data Collection for Self-Hosters</h2>
  <p>For self-hosted installations, Invoice Ninja does NOT collect data other than limited PII for paid account management:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Account username and email (paid accounts)</li>
    <li>Company details (name, website, phone, address, VAT/ID numbers)</li>
    <li>Sub-user names and emails</li>
    <li>Industry and company size</li>
    <li>Geolocation via IP (paid accounts)</li>
    <li>Billing information (paid accounts)</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Data Control & Erasure</h2>
  <p>Self-hosters can request complete PII purging by contacting <a href="mailto:privacy@invoiceninja.com">privacy@invoiceninja.com</a>. Invoice Ninja commits to deletion within 2 business days.</p>

  <h2>Error Reporting</h2>
  <p>Users can voluntarily submit anonymized error data to Invoice Ninja servers for debugging purposes only.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p><a href="mailto:privacy@invoiceninja.com">privacy@invoiceninja.com</a> or <a href="mailto:legal@invoiceninja.com">legal@invoiceninja.com</a></p>
</LegalLayout>
